1
00:00:00,068 --> 00:00:03,346
Patung Liberty ternyata
dijuluki "Colossus Baru"...

2
00:00:03,346 --> 00:00:07,192
karena Colossus lama konon berdiri
mengangkang di pintu pelabuhan!

3
00:00:07,192 --> 00:00:10,313
Patung dewa matahari setinggi 33 meter...

4
00:00:10,313 --> 00:00:12,750
kapal-kapal katanya
lewat di bawah kakinya!

5
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:13,552
Tapi,

6
00:00:13,552 --> 00:00:14,863
itu mustahil.

7
00:00:14,863 --> 00:00:17,583
Ia kemungkinan berdiri
di tepi pelabuhan...

8
00:00:17,583 --> 00:00:19,276
lalu roboh karena gempa.

9
00:00:19,276 --> 00:00:22,325
Reruntuhannya tergeletak
800 tahun lebih...

10
00:00:22,325 --> 00:00:24,706
sampai konon dijual sebagai rongsokan,

11
00:00:24,706 --> 00:00:26,977
diangkut 900 unta!

12
00:00:26,977 --> 00:00:27,613
Follow,

13
00:00:27,613 --> 00:00:29,913
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
